sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% ================= 流程一：宽松打卡（P0 核心） =================
    actor U as 用户
    participant P as 首页/圈子详情
    participant Panel as LooseCheckinPanel
    participant Svc as CheckinService(前端)
    participant API as CheckinController
    participant Biz as CheckinServiceImpl
    participant DB as checkin_records
    participant Stats as /checkin/stats/mine

    U->>P: 点击打卡按钮
    P->>Panel: open(planId?, circleId?)
    Panel->>Panel: 读取 lastExerciseType / lastCircleId
    Panel->>Svc: getMyCircles() 加载可选圈子(默认最近加入)
    U->>Panel: 选类型/时长(15/30/45/60或手动1-480)/圈子/照片/备注
    U->>Panel: 点击完成打卡
    Panel->>Svc: createCheckin({planId?, circleId, duration, exerciseType, photoUrl, remark})
    Svc->>API: POST /checkin
    API->>Biz: checkin(planId?, circleId, duration, ...)
    alt planId 非空
        Biz->>Biz: 校验计划存在/进行中/是成员/圈子未归档
        Biz->>Biz: 校验 duration >= plan.minDurationPerCheckin
    else planId 为空(宽松打卡)
        Biz->>Biz: 仅校验 duration 在 1-480 全局范围
    end
    Biz->>Biz: circleId 非空时校验是圈子成员
    Biz->>DB: INSERT(plan_id?, circle_id, duration, ...)
    DB-->>Biz: CheckinRecord
    Biz-->>API: record
    API-->>Svc: Result.success(record)
    Svc-->>Panel: record
    Panel->>Panel: toast 打卡成功 + 摘要(本次时长/类型)
    Panel->>Svc: getMyStats()
    Svc->>Stats: GET /checkin/stats/mine
    Stats-->>Panel: {todayDuration, totalDuration, checkinDays, totalCheckins, currentStreak, completionRate}
    Panel->>Panel: 显示今日累计 todayDuration
    Panel->>P: 1.5s 后 onSuccess()
    P->>P: 刷新今日统计与列表

    %% ================= 流程二：圈子归档（创建者） =================
    actor C as 创建者
    participant D as 圈子详情页
    participant CS as CircleService(前端)
    participant CC as CircleController
    participant CZ as CircleServiceImpl
    participant T as circles 表

    C->>D: 设置区点击"归档圈子"
    D->>D: Taro.showModal 二次确认
    C->>D: 确认
    D->>CS: archiveCircle(circleId)
    CS->>CC: POST /circles/{id}/archive
    CC->>CZ: archiveCircle(circleId, userId)
    CZ->>CZ: 校验创建者(creatorId==userId)
    CZ->>T: UPDATE status = 0
    T-->>CZ: ok
    CZ-->>CC: Result.success
    CC-->>D: 200
    D->>D: 刷新 → 显示"已归档"标签 + 提示条 + 隐藏打卡/创建计划按钮
